      "title": "Model Links",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Model Links \n\n\n**diffusion_models**\n\n- [Krea 2 Models](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/tree/main/diffusion_models)  \n\n**text_encoders**\n- [bf16 text encoder](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen3-VL/blob/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_bf16.safetensors) better than fp8 but larger\n- [fp8 text encoder](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen3-VL/blob/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors) \n\n- [Abliterated text encoder](https://huggingface.co/ahmed22xa/Huihui-Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct-abliterated-comfy/tree/main) is an uncensored text encoder that might give better results for certain images.\n\n**vae**\n\n- [qwen_image_vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/resolve/main/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors)\n\n**loras**\n\n- [TextFusion Refusal](https://civitai.com/models/2775340/krea2-textfusion-refusal-reduction-lora?modelVersionId=3125118)\n- [Turbo LoRA](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/blob/main/loras/krea2_turbo_lora_rank_64_bf16.safetensors) this is only needed if you use the Raw model (recommended for this workflow).\n\n**custom nodes**\n\n- [Krea2TexTEncoder](https://github.com/ethanfel/ComfyUI-Krea2TextEncoder)\n\n## Model Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │   └── krea2 model file\n│   ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n│   │   └── qwen text encoder files\n│   ├── 📂 vae/\n│   │   └── qwen_image_vae.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 loras/\n│       └── LoRA files\n```\n\n"
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
